	(text "Changes in 3.0A:\n- Move from TQFP XC6XLS9 to a BGA XC6XLS25 Spartan variant \n  for more I/O and logic capacity.\n- Extend SRAM from 512k x 8 chips to 512k x 16 for double \n  RAM capacity\n- move SPI selector into the FPGA\n"
